mbit/ffi/gambitffi-load-failure.ss:67:(ffi-gate-finish \"gambitffi-load-failure-smoke\")\nhost/gambit/ffi/ffi-harness.ss:1:;; ffi-harness.ss — shared harness for the gambitffi* stage-1 gates.\nhost/gambit/ffi/ffi-harness.ss:3:;; ##include-spliced by each gate script (same-unit rule as gambitcheck: the\nhost/gambit/ffi/ffi-harness.ss:56:        (error 'gambitffi-abi \"missing/unsupported errno accessor selection; run make gambitffi-abi\"))))\nhost/gambit/ffi/joltffi-bridge.scm:2:;; generated-shims.scm supplies typed calls from shapes.json (including the\nhost/gambit/ffi/joltffi-bridge.scm:265:(##include \"generated-shims.scm\")\nhost/gambit/ffi/generate-shims.py:4:shapes.json records the source inventory and finite ABI fixture additions.\nhost/gambit/ffi/generate-shims.py:10:shapes = json.loads((root / 'shapes.json').read_text())['shapes']\nhost/gambit/ffi/generate-shims.py:23:c = [';; GENERATED by generate-shims.py; edit shapes.json and regenerate.', '(c-declare #<<SHIMS']\nhost/gambit/ffi/generate-shims.py:66:    if (root / 'generated-shims.scm').read_text() != output:\nhost/gambit/ffi/generate-shims.py:67:        raise SystemExit('generated-shims.scm is stale')\nhost/gambit/ffi/generate-shims.py:69:    (root / 'generated-shims.scm').write_text(output)\nhost/gambit/ffi/gambitffi-errno.ss:36:(ffi-gate-finish \"gambitffi-errno-check\")\nhost/gambit/ffi/DIGESTS.txt:2:87397f16bf4700f0a9bd845dcbc9fd9b68e5e1fb392549c70b474a608cf0b7ea  host/gambit/ffi/generated-shims.scm\nhost/gambit/ffi/DIGESTS.txt:3:82b25a4d2994347fe4a50c8bdfe49cdbbcf2ab6a68c66c560279b01461dcba64  host/gambit/ffi/shapes.json\nhost/gambit/ffi/README.md:13:make gambitffi gambitcheck gambitkernel gambiteval GAMBIT_PREFIX=\"$GAMBIT_PREFIX\"\nhost/gambit/ffi/README.md:17:All new FFI gates fail if their toolchain or bridge is absent. `gambitcheck`\nhost/gambit/ffi/README.md:21:A timed-out gate kills its process group and returns 124. `gambitffi` also\nhost/gambit/ffi/README.md:22:requires `emittedheads`, whic